---
title: Basic Lentil Pasta Sauce
author: Jonathan Simmonds
tags: vegan
yields: 8 x 320%g
servings: 8
prep time: 20 minutes
cook time: 45 minutes
---

Fry @onion{3}(diced), @carrot{3}(diced), and @pepper{1}(diced) in a #large pan{} for ~{10%minutes}.

Add @lentils{320%g}, @chopped tomatoes{2%tin}, @passata{1%tin}, @cayenne{1%tsp}, @thyme{}, @garlic{1}(minced), @nutmeg{}, @olives{}, @red wine{100%ml}, and @water{200%ml}.

Simmer for ~{45%minutes} until the lentils disappear and the tomatoes have broken down into a thick sauce.
